Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:01.31,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 918.03 993.05 l 787.54 899.23 1059.97 894.66 1050.81 1070.85)\i1}Wealth, fame, power...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.31,0:00:01.40,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 503.66 1057.12 l 327.37 887.8 1089.73 892.37 1075.99 1052.54)}{\i1}Wealth, fame, power...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.94,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wealth, fame, power...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:04.44,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.36,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}attained this and everything else\Nthe world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:10.82,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}And his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.37,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:13.70,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:17.04,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.25,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.75,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}These words lured\Nmen to the Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.92,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}in pursuit of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:29.85,Opening-Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}This is the time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=51}============================= OPENING NARRATION ==============================
