Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=38}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:30.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is his arm okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he took a single step back\Nhis arm would've been ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:36.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah but he wasn't thinking\Nabout how animal fangs work,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that'd require a tiny\Nbit of brain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he okay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think Big Bro Luffy's\Narm will make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey... Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:02.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy! The sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:03.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey, look! A shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:10.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasping]\NNo, that's Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So wait. He went under?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap... This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:21.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His abilities double in strength\Nwhen he's under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:28.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] Once my momentum\Nin the water builds up, it's impossible to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:34.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This is precisely the kind of ability that\Nmakes us fishmen all the more superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:37.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:46.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now... It's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shark Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:54.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.45,0:03:58.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A torpedo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:03.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Something\Njust flew out of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:06.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you could dodge that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:21.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the longer you evade your death,\Nthe more painful it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG] Shark... Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:43.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what kind of bones does\Nthat crazy shark have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His nose crushed the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG] Shark Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:57.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:05:01.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:09.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hey Luffy, hide! Arlong\Nwent into the sea again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Big Bro!\NYou gotta hide from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's setting his sights\Non you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:19.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop being so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:31.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go run for cover before\Nyou become a target!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No way!\NI'm not running anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna catch him and break his nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs] You've got some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:48.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or you realized, that it's\Npointless to try and hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear us telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you should go somewhere and hide?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You barely escaped his last attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he lands just one direct\Nhit it'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen to us! Go and hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:10.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey wait! What's that position?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think that'll stop the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] I'll get double the\Nspeed from this distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll pierce your\Nheart rubber man... now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:23.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... take this... Shark Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Heh, heh, heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls] Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... Did he get hit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:48.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's fine. He somehow\Nmanaged to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs] It's over!\NThat attack, won't work now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG] Shark Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:06:59.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard! That was just pure luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Fat chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:12.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Finger Net!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fishy, fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:25.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:35.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:38.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP squeals]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:50.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you see the intensity in his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the same expression that\NSea Kings make before they snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:59.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He must have snapped\Nwith Luffy's last attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.61,0:08:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] His eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... I've never seen them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You wretched human!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:13.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What have you done\Nto me?! A mighty fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa... That was crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:29.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It didn't actually hurt but I can\Ntell he's really like... madder...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, man... What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The saw blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That thing is gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:59.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[DOCTOR] He won't stop...\NLuffy'll get cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He jumped in the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:33.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] The left window.\NOn the top floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the room that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.29,0:09:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] There's nowhere else to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and me... Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... in the highest level of Arlong Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:46.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lotta paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't just any room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the room where I make Nami\Ndraw all of her sea charts for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:57.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] The map room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] This is Nami's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] These sea charts are\Nwhat she's worked on all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no one else on\Nthe face of the planet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:10.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that can draw sea charts with\Nsuch accuracy and efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That young lady has a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:26.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And there really isn't anything as ultimately\Nregrettable as wasting natural talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Staying here and drawing up\Nsea charts for me is her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:32.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,only chance at living up\Nto her full potential!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] This pen is stained with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In order for me to\Nattain world supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:43.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her sea charts are absolutely vital!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:48.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She will continue drawing her\Nsea charts for my own ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And once her charts give me full\Nknowledge of all the world's oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:55.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we fishmen will be totally invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:58.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the world shall kneel before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The first step is this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we'll move on to\Nthe whole East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:06.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You could never use her like me!\NShe would be wasted on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:23.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] What the...? The Shark Saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:29.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Use her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.76,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] What's happening?\NAre they still fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:41.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?!\NDammit Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you okay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:45.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] I wish we knew\Nwhat was goin' on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:53.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you take her for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]\NShe's an inferior creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:00.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but she has risen far above her peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If all other humans are sewer rats,\Nthan she's a feisty little kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:06.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all she {\i1}is{\i0} adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:10.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She has her place and\Nit's here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can give her everything she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the only thing she has\Nto do is continue drawing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,those marvelous charts for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:28.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Nami will forever\Nbe my tool... or no...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:29.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... she'll be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:39.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Uh! What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:44.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] It's a desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay... It was just a desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:51.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man I was scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought that was\NBig Bro Luffy for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:54.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear that\Nkind of talk from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:12:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] What?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were scared too, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Don't be stupid! I just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Arlong\Nflying through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:10.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] What a load of crap!\NYou were scared! Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:11.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Admit what, you jerk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Admit that I know Arlong's goin' down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,0,255,0,0,110,2110)}There's no way that Big Bro\NLuffy is gonna lose this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:17.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's goin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:27.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why's all that stuff being\Nthrown outta there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:40.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Alright. As of today,\Nthis will be your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Your desk. Your pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:45.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything you'll need is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] The charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] My charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:02.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Dumb brat... You can't\Ntrick me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:05.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Trying to draw up fake charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:11.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] I can't believe you waste\Nyour time drawing crap like this in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:11.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] If you ever try to\Npull a stunt like this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll drag all those villagers in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.01,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and make you watch as I\Ncrush every single one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,... just like with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's eight year's worth of work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eight years of planning and ambition!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:43.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Bellemere... Nojiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:45.28,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow... This fight is\Nso freakin' intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... A fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Now you've gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You keep jabbering on about\Nhow much better fishmen are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and how much you need\Nthose sea charts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:27.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand anything\Nabout that stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but, I finally figured\Nout how to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:32.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This room isn't anything\Nbut her jail cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's only one way\Nfor Nami to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.07,0:15:44.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got to tear this place apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park cannot be brought\Ndown by some inferior human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Especially not by some\Nrubbery freak like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shark Tooth Drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:15:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ARLONG yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Battle-Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:13.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:40.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts, panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It looks like Arlong\NPark is coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] It's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C] Everybody run for cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Sis! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Luffy's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:16:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't! Luffy's still...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:02.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:07.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:24.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell? What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park has... fallen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:20.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just wonder what went on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:23.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta know who won.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With all that debris... Looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:29.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:41.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU cry] Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He's just standing there... What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:18:59.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! You'll always be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=39}===============================DIALOGUE============================
